### Notion RAG Chatbot API Tests

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get Sync Status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Trigger Sync
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Check Sync Status After Trigger
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Chat Request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "프로젝트 설정에 대해 알려줘"
}

###

### 6. Another Chat Request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
